    "end": 10
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Mrs. Williams",
   "en": "Better. Thank you, doctor.",
   "zh": "他好些了。谢谢您，医生。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 10,
    "end": 12.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "Can I see him please, Mrs. Williams?",
   "zh": "我可以看看他吗，威廉斯夫人？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 12.4,
    "end": 15.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Mrs. Williams",
   "en": "Certainly, doctor.",
   "zh": "当然可以，医生。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 15.7,
    "end": 17.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Mrs. Williams",
   "en": "Come upstairs.",
   "zh": "上楼吧。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 17.1,
    "end": 19.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "You look very well, Jimmy.",
   "zh": "你看上去很好，吉米。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 19.4,
    "end": 22.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "You are better now, but you mustn't get up yet.",
   "zh": "你现在好些了，但你还不应该起床。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 22.7,
    "end": 27.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "You must stay in bed for another two days.",
   "zh": "你必须再卧床两天。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 27.7,
    "end": 32.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "The boy mustn't go to school yet, Mrs. Williams.",
   "zh": "这孩子还不能去上学，威廉斯夫人，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 32.7,
    "end": 36.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "And he mustn't eat rich food.",
   "zh": "而且不能吃油腻的食物。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 36.5,
    "end": 39.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Mrs. Williams",
   "en": "Does he have a temperature, doctor?",
   "zh": "他还发烧吗，医生？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 39.9,
    "end": 43
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "No, he doesn't.",
   "zh": "不，他不发烧了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 43,
    "end": 45.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Mrs. Williams",
   "en": "Must he stay in bed?",
   "zh": "他还必须卧床吗？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 45.3,
    "end": 47.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "Yes. He must remain in bed for another two days.",
   "zh": "是的，他还必须卧床两天。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 47.2,
    "end": 52.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "He can get up for about two hours each day,",
   "zh": "他每天可以起来两个小时，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 52.1,
    "end": 55.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "but you must keep the room warm.",
   "zh": "但您必须保持房间温暖。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
    "start": 55.8,
    "end": 59.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Doctor",
   "en": "Where's Mr. Williams this evening?",
   "zh": "威廉斯先生今晚去哪儿了？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L063.mp4",
